192
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:47,840
Ready? Firing!

193
00:15:49,020 --> 00:15:56,020
This particular bullet went 731 feet per second.

194
00:15:56,021 --> 00:15:59,020
That's 498 miles per hour.

195
00:15:59,021 --> 00:16:02,020
The glass has taken a hit, but has not failed.

196
00:16:02,021 --> 00:16:07,020
A piece of cardboard placed behind the glass has no signs of damage.

197
00:16:07,021 --> 00:16:09,020
