198
00:16:09,021 --> 00:16:16,020
Nothing got through it at all, and it has not broken down to the point where it would be considered a test failure.

199
00:16:16,021 --> 00:16:18,620
To find the breaking point, we'll have to go further,

200
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:21,700
