201
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:24,700
Ready? Firing!

202
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,160
931 miles per hour.

203
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:34,800
There's damage to the glass, but still no failure.

204
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:39,240
We retire the handgun and set up a device called a receiver.

205
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:44,000
It can fire the kind of ammunition used in an AK-47,

206
00:16:44,001 --> 00:16:49,660
A bullet with a pointed tip, a smaller diameter, and a higher velocity.

